          "text": "If I were a boy",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I think I could understand (Oh-ooh)",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "How it feels to love a girl",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I swear I'd be a better man",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
